        "original_id": "d2711571-6ed9-5f21-bc3e-bc9d87bbcc83",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rick Hart, Steven Seagal, Tommy Lee Jones, Gary Busey, J. F. Lawton\n- Films/TV: Under Siege, Pretty Woman, Mistress, Blankman, The Hunted, Chain Reaction, Jackson, V.I.P., Cannibal Women in the Avocado Jungle of Death, Pizza Man, Marked for Death\n- Roles/Concepts: Academy Award for Best Sound, ex-Navy SEAL, mercenaries, former DEA troubleshooter, screenwriting, directing, assumed name J.D. Athens\n- Places/Systems: USS Missouri, U.S. Navy\n\nFacts:\n- Rick Hart was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Sound for the film \"Under Siege.\"\n- \"Under Siege\" stars Steven Seagal as an ex-Navy SEAL who must stop mercenaries led by Tommy Lee Jones and Gary Busey on the U.S. Navy battleship USS \"Missouri.\"\n- J. F. Lawton's screen credits include \"Pretty Woman,\" \"Mistress,\" \"Blankman,\" \"Under Siege,\" \"The Hunted,\" \"Chain Reaction,\" \"Jackson,\" and the TV series \"V.I.P.\"\n- Under the assumed name J.D. Athens, J. F. Lawton wrote and directed \"Cannibal Women in the Avocado Jungle of Death\" and \"Pizza Man.\"\n- \"Marked for Death\" stars Steven Seagal as John Hatcher, a former DEA troubleshooter.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
